{"id":"u20","kelas":9,"no":2,"judul":"Teks Laporan","title":"Report Text","emoji":"🦁","ringkas":"Mengklasifikasikan dan melaporkan fakta umum","ready":true,"goals":["memahami struktur **report text**: General Classification dan Description","membedakan report text dengan descriptive text dan narrative text","memakai **simple present** dan **kata benda jamak umum** (cats, elephants)","menyebut ciri, habitat, makanan, dan manfaat dalam teks laporan","membaca teks laporan pendek dan menjawab pertanyaan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di buku IPA atau ensiklopedia, ada teks yang menjelaskan **fakta umum** tentang hewan, tumbuhan, atau fenomena alam. Itulah **report text**. Di **Unit 2 Kelas 9** kamu belajar membaca dan menulisnya."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur report text","table":[["Bagian","Isi","Contoh"],["**General Classification**","menyebut dan mengelompokkan topik secara umum","[[Elephants are the largest land animals in the world.]]"],["**Description**","fakta: bagian, sifat, habitat, makanan, kebiasaan, manfaat","[[They have long trunks and big ears. They eat plants and live in groups.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Report atau descriptive?","text":"Keduanya sama-sama menjelaskan, tapi berbeda sasaran:","table":[["","Descriptive text","Report text"],["**Sasaran**","satu hal tertentu (Borobudur, kucingku Mimi)","**kelompok atau jenis** secara umum (elephants, volcanoes)"],["**Contoh**","[[My cat, Mimi, has soft fur.]]","[[Cats have soft fur.]]"],["**Subjek**","tunggal dan spesifik (my cat, Borobudur)","umum, sering jamak (cats, elephants)"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Ciri bahasa report text","text":"• **Simple present tense** (fakta yang benar umumnya).\n• Subjek umum dan sering **jamak**: *Cats*, *Tigers*, *Volcanoes*.\n• Kata penghubung: **and, but, also, usually, mostly**.\n• Tidak memakai kata ganti pribadi seperti *I* atau *my*."},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata laporan tentang hewan","items":[{"en":"mammal","id":"mamalia","ex":"Elephants are mammals."},{"en":"reptile","id":"reptil","ex":"A crocodile is a reptile."},{"en":"bird","id":"burung","ex":"Birds have wings."},{"en":"habitat","id":"habitat / tempat hidup","ex":"The forest is their habitat."},{"en":"herbivore","id":"hewan pemakan tumbuhan","ex":"Cows are herbivores."},{"en":"carnivore","id":"hewan pemakan daging","ex":"Tigers are carnivores."},{"en":"omnivore","id":"pemakan segala","ex":"Bears are omnivores."},{"en":"live in","id":"tinggal di","ex":"Monkeys live in trees."},{"en":"feed on","id":"memakan","ex":"Elephants feed on plants."},{"en":"protected","id":"dilindungi","ex":"Komodo dragons are protected animals."},{"en":"endangered","id":"terancam punah","ex":"Orangutans are endangered."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Pola kalimat yang berguna","table":[["Tujuan","Pola","Contoh"],["Mengelompokkan","**X is/are + a/the + kelompok**","[[Komodo dragons are reptiles.]]"],["Menyebut bagian","**X has/have + noun**","[[They have strong legs and sharp claws.]]"],["Menyebut tempat hidup","**X live(s) in/on/at ...**","[[They live on Komodo Island.]]"],["Menyebut makanan","**X eat(s) / feed(s) on ...**","[[They eat deer and other animals.]]"],["Menyebut kemampuan","**X can + kata kerja**","[[They can run fast.]]"],["Menyebut manfaat/status","**X is/are used for / protected**","[[Bamboo is used to make furniture.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Komodo Dragons","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Komodo dragons are the largest living lizards in the world. They are reptiles, and they live on Komodo Island and some small islands in Indonesia.","id":"Komodo adalah kadal hidup terbesar di dunia. Mereka reptil dan tinggal di Pulau Komodo dan beberapa pulau kecil di Indonesia. (General Classification)"},{"who":"Text","en":"They have long tails, strong legs, and sharp claws. They can grow up to about three meters long.","id":"Mereka punya ekor panjang, kaki kuat, dan cakar tajam. Panjangnya bisa sampai sekitar tiga meter. (Description: ciri)"},{"who":"Text","en":"Komodo dragons are carnivores. They usually eat deer, pigs, and other animals. They are protected, so people mustn't hunt them.","id":"Komodo pemakan daging. Mereka biasanya makan rusa, babi, dan hewan lain. Mereka dilindungi, jadi orang tidak boleh memburunya. (Description: makanan dan status)"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: Elephants","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Elephants are the biggest land animals in the world. They are mammals.","id":"Gajah adalah hewan darat terbesar di dunia. Mereka mamalia. (General Classification)"},{"who":"Text","en":"They have big ears, long trunks, and thick gray skin. They live in groups, and they feed on grass, leaves, and fruit.","id":"Mereka punya telinga besar, belalai panjang, dan kulit abu-abu yang tebal. Mereka hidup berkelompok dan memakan rumput, daun, dan buah. (Description)"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Report text = **General Classification + Description** (fakta umum).","Pakai **simple present** dan subjek umum yang sering **jamak**: [[Elephants are ...]]","Report membahas **kelompok** secara umum; descriptive membahas **satu hal** tertentu.","Kosakata: [[mammal]], [[reptile]], [[habitat]], [[herbivore]], [[carnivore]], [[endangered]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["habitat","tempat hidup"],["herbivore","pemakan tumbuhan"],["carnivore","pemakan daging"],["endangered","terancam punah"],["protected","dilindungi"]],"exp":"Kosakata sains hewan.","k":"f4df93c8"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian report text dengan isinya:","pairs":[["General Classification","menyebut dan mengelompokkan topik"],["Description","fakta tentang ciri, habitat, makanan"],["Orientation","bagian narrative, bukan report"]],"exp":"Report text hanya punya dua bagian: classification dan description.","k":"0f75f8eb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat General Classification?","options":["Elephants are mammals.","Elephants eat grass.","Elephants live in groups.","Elephants have big ears."],"answer":0,"exp":"Mengelompokkan = menyebut jenis (mammals).","k":"62f6e8a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang merupakan report text?","options":["Cats have soft fur and sharp claws.","My cat Mimi is very small.","I went to Bali last year.","Please open the door."],"answer":0,"exp":"Report membahas hewan secara umum (cats).","k":"6679e2d7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang biasa dipakai di report text adalah...","options":["simple past","simple present","future","past continuous"],"answer":1,"exp":"Fakta umum → simple present.","k":"54a3f6c4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Gajah adalah mamalia.","q":"Elephants ___ mammals.","answers":["are"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"Elephants jamak → are.","k":"421584cc"},{"type":"fill","id":"Harimau memakan daging.","q":"Tigers ___ meat.","answers":["eat"],"hint":"eat / eats ?","exp":"Tigers jamak → eat (tanpa -s).","k":"c1c8d636"},{"type":"fill","id":"Komodo hidup di Pulau Komodo.","q":"They ___ on Komodo Island.","answers":["live"],"hint":"l _ _ _","exp":"They → live.","k":"d6d55396"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["A cow are a herbivore.","Cows are herbivores.","Cows is herbivores.","A cows herbivores."],"answer":1,"exp":"Cows jamak → are herbivores.","k":"cb1a1ece"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Birds has wings.","Birds have wings.","Birds is have wings.","Birds having wings."],"answer":1,"exp":"Birds jamak → have.","k":"74576a42"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Hewan pemakan tumbuhan disebut...","options":["carnivore","herbivore","reptile","habitat"],"answer":1,"exp":"herbivore = pemakan tumbuhan.","k":"3be142e6"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Komodo dilindungi di Indonesia.\"","answer":"Komodo dragons are protected in Indonesia.","exp":"Subjek jamak + are + protected + in + tempat.","k":"5b9d5d55"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Gajah memakan rumput dan daun.\"","answer":"Elephants feed on grass and leaves.","exp":"Elephants + feed on + makanan.","k":"8f0dd09b"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Hewan apa yang dibicarakan?","say":"They are reptiles and they have long tails","options":["Reptil dengan ekor panjang","Mamalia dengan telinga besar","Burung dengan sayap","Ikan dengan sirip"],"answer":0,"exp":"reptiles = reptil; long tails = ekor panjang.","k":"ef3ac696"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Tigers are carnivores","options":["Harimau pemakan daging","Harimau pemakan rumput","Harimau pemakan segala","Harimau hidup di laut"],"answer":0,"exp":"carnivore = pemakan daging.","k":"f2299973"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian mana yang merupakan Description?","options":["Komodo dragons are reptiles.","They have strong legs and sharp claws.","Komodo dragons live in Indonesia.","Komodo dragons are famous."],"answer":1,"exp":"Ciri fisik = Description.","k":"3a82ad0d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan hewan dengan kelompoknya:","pairs":[["tiger","mammal"],["crocodile","reptile"],["eagle","bird"],["cow","mammal (herbivore)"],["lizard","reptile (lizard)"]],"exp":"Kelompok hewan.","k":"770e86a2"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis makanan dengan jenis hewannya:","pairs":[["herbivore","memakan tumbuhan"],["carnivore","memakan daging"],["omnivore","memakan tumbuhan dan daging"]],"exp":"Herbivore, carnivore, omnivore.","k":"b59ae2e5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat General Classification?","options":["Tigers are big cats.","Tigers have stripes.","Tigers live in forests.","Tigers eat meat."],"answer":0,"exp":"Mengelompokkan = menyebut jenis.","k":"c7db7327"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang BUKAN report text?","options":["My cat sleeps on my bed every night.","Cats are mammals.","Cats have sharp claws.","Cats eat fish and meat."],"answer":0,"exp":"Report tidak memakai kata ganti pribadi (my).","k":"7c3bdc6b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["Crocodiles live in rivers.","Crocodiles lives in rivers.","A crocodiles live in rivers.","Crocodile live in rivers."],"answer":0,"exp":"Crocodiles jamak → live.","k":"e11f6892"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kali